% composition-elements: steady beat, speed, volume and sound quality — move on the beat and leave room for a partner's choice
% composition-listen: Miriam Makeba — "Pata Pata"
% composition-listen-url: https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Miriam+Makeba+Pata+Pata+official
% composition-bridge: Hear how repeated vocal and instrumental ideas make social movement feel communal; notice leader and group energy.
% composition-context: Miriam Makeba's internationally known recording can open a lesson on South African popular music, language, dance and apartheid-era history. This is a new movement chant, not a "Pata Pata" arrangement.
% composition-distance: Original melody and English words; no hook, bass line or lyric from the recording is used.
