% dossier-honesty: Original social-movement chant beside a listening study of Makeba.
% dossier-licence: Draft original; the reference recording remains copyrighted.
% dossier-respect: Teach Makeba's name, language and political context; do not reduce the recording to an anonymous dance beat.
% dossier-review: Early-years teacher and South African music educator.
